  "prefLabel": "Puc 3003.02 Commission Adjudication of Consumer Complaints",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 3003.02 Commission Adjudication of Consumer Complaints.\n\n(a) Pursuant to Puc 203.06 and Puc 203.07, customer complaints transferred to the commission for adjudication shall be in the form of a petition.\n\n(b) Pursuant to RSA 541-A:31, RSA 365:4, and RSA 365:5, the commission shall commence an adjudicative proceeding to resolve a customer complaint against a CNGS or aggregator alleging that the CNGS or aggregator is not in compliance with the provisions of En 3000.\n\nSource. #12757, eff 6-1-19; ss by #14613, eff 6-5-26, EXPIRES: 6-5-36 (formerly Puc 3005.07)\n\nAPPENDIX",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/puc3000.html"
